---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Zero Tracking & Client-Side Calculation Guarantee | AIO Calculator"
  description="Read AIO Calculator's privacy policy. We operate under a strict zero-data-retention model: calculations run locally in your browser without tracking personal numbers."
  canonicalPath="/privacy-policy/"
  schemaType="website"
>
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 2rem; padding-bottom: 4rem;">
    <article class="prose" style="margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
      <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-slate-500); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        Last Updated: October 30, 2026
      </div>

      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

      <p class="lead" style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--color-slate-700); line-height: 1.6;">
        At AIO Calculator (https://aio-calculator.com/), your personal privacy is fundamental to our architecture. We operate on a strict <strong>Zero Data Retention</strong> policy: your financial numbers, health statistics, passwords, and calculation inputs remain strictly on your local device.
      </p>

      <h2>1. In-Browser Client Calculations</h2>
      <p>
        The calculations on AIO Calculator execute using client-side JavaScript running directly in your web browser memory. When you enter a loan principal, mortgage interest rate, body weight, or generate a random password, <strong>none of those numbers are uploaded to our web servers, saved in a database, or shared with third parties</strong>.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We do <strong>not</strong> require user accounts, logins, or email sign-ups to use any calculator.</li>
        <li>We do <strong>not</strong> collect personal financial numbers, salary amounts, debt balances, or tax filing statuses.</li>
        <li>We do <strong>not</strong> store health measurements, weight, height, menstrual cycles, or due dates.</li>
        <li>We do <strong>not</strong> log or transmit passwords generated by our Tech and Security tools; all passwords are generated using <code>crypto.getRandomValues()</code> directly on your hardware.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Standard Web Server Logging</h2>
      <p>
        Like virtually all websites, our hosting servers automatically log standard, non-identifying technical metadata necessary for network reliability, DDoS mitigation, and server security. This may include:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Internet Protocol (IP) address</li>
        <li>Browser user-agent and operating system version</li>
        <li>Requested URL path and timestamp</li>
        <li>Referring webpage header</li>
      </ul>
      <p>These server logs are never linked to any calculator inputs.</p>

      <h2>4. Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
      <p>
        AIO Calculator does not use invasive cross-site tracking cookies. We may use standard browser session storage or local storage exclusively to remember user-selected UI preferences (such as Metric vs Imperial unit toggles or dark mode preferences) strictly on your device.
      </p>

      <h2>5. AI Search Engines and Crawlers</h2>
      <p>
        AIO Calculator allows authorized search engines and AI answer engines (including Googlebot, OAI-SearchBot, PerplexityBot, and Claude-SearchBot) to crawl our public HTML formulas and educational FAQs to provide accurate citation responses to web users.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Contact Regarding Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or our client-side architecture, contact us at <code>privacy@aio-calculator.com</code> or visit our <a href="/contact-us/">Contact Us page</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
